  "content": "<h4>如有任何問題，請提交至&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/PssbleTrngle/MiscIssues/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p>本模組還為<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/tinkers-construct\" rel=\"nofollow\">匠魂</a>工具屬性添加了<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a>資訊畫面：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/293/52/prismarine.gif\" width=\"236\" height=\"234\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/293/51/enderium.gif\" width=\"236\" height=\"234\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>整合包使用：<strong>允許，</strong>但請將塑膠廢棄物減至最低以守護地球</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
